      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Good point regarding the colliders. DynBone colliders are EXTREMELY EXPENSIVE so keeping them minimized as much as possible is ideal. \n\nI've updated the documentation to point to our Optimization doc, which should always be up to date and be considered the authoritative source.\n\nFinally, I know that this is quite stringent, but Public Avatar worlds have some excessive performance issues. Having 500+ DynBone transforms is simply unacceptable. A world being made public means that VRChat has looked at the world and effectively endorses it, so keep that in mind.\n\nThanks for the feedback!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
