      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm sorry, but to me it seems plainly obvious that you're complaining because your world got denied. Your world is clearly among the biggest offenders: https://i.imgur.com/NhqRy3h.png\n\nThe collider situation is a little weird right now. I think a better solution would be to have dynamic bone transforms count as an extra transform for every collider they respond to. This means that a single hair bone will count as 3 transforms if it can be touched by a left hand and a right hand collider. Then increase this new limit a little, to something like 70.\n\nA material limit of 10 is absolutely fine. You honestly don't need more than 10 different shaders on a model.\n\nAlso, distant disable is already forced active by default ingame.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
