      "value": "@{5adfa711a8ca626f7bf243ae|full_name}: I think a lot of people 'forget' to use texture atlases; As you said, 10 different shaders is probably the real edge-case, most avatars would be far below that.\nMy current avatar actually only has 2 materials as I only use flat lit toon and a different shader for some other parts. No reason for the other materials to be seperate.\nIf avatars are made to be publicly available, they need to be optimised. ¯\\_(ツ)_/¯",
