      "value": "My world has been rejected multiple times cause vrchat claims theres more components than there truly are. 2 dynamic colliders - my world was rejected cause it had ONE, \"20\" materials - my world was rejected cause they have 10. They need to loosen up and add a wider mercy line. Yes optomization is good but there are some things I cannot optomize any further without ruining the avatar. Vrchat needs to easeup because they obviously are a lot more strict on the regulations than what they claim is allowed.",
