  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-11-16T19:58:32.743Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The current guidelines are really bad and don't make sense at all.\n\ncurrent guidelines here: <snip>\n\nas you can see having only 1 dynamic bones colliders is really a bad idea since not being able to have 1 collider per hand is just stupid. \n\nsee how every single avatar world gets denied: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/2PACX-1vShHzuZzQwULCu7KmWFGMj640oNRYH-M_N1BD30nRF5F9eqGYcLF0E-CTf48RE8qzAzDmv9eqJsdpma/pubhtml?gid=1122762578&single=true\n\nI suggest:\nMax Mats: 20\nMax Skinned Mesh renderer: 3\nMax Dynamic Bones: 50\nMax Dynamic Bone Collider: 5\n\nalso since the script can be changed server sided, just enable distance disable on every script. VRChat is changing the update rate server sided already, so do the same with the distance disable.",
